<title>USA: Biogen Sept 30 Q3 shr rises to $1.21.</title>
<headline>Biogen Sept 30 Q3 shr rises to $1.21.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.21		    $0.03</p>
<p> Net		 45,052		   1,128</p>
<p> Revs		27,517		   nil</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  37,285		   36,720</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.89		    $0.13</p>
<p> Net		 32,301		   4,676</p>
<p> Revs		33,642		   nil</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  36,198		   35,978</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Biogen Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said in the third quarter of 1996 it received a one-time royalty payment of $30 million plus a precentage of sales of Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn's recombinent human growth protein in return for patent rights to Biogen's protein-secretion technology. The company also said it recorded a one-time tax benefit of $23 million.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
